tality, Sployer, HulKiora, Nvr_K, place, respectively, 1st, 2nd, 4th &amp; 5th of the UN Olympics 1v1.</li>\n<li><i>March 29th</i> - Antares wins the UN Olympics Trio. Royaume Du Rex places 4th of the UN Olympics FFA.</li>\n<li><i>April 20th</i> - ImSoBad joins.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</h2></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"table2 table2--generic\"><div class=\"table2__container\"><table class=\"table2__table sortable\"><tbody><tr class=\"table2__row--head table2__row--head-title\"><th data-sort-type=\"isoDate\">Date</th><th data-align=\"center\">Place</th><th>Tier</th><th colspan=\"2\">Tournament</th><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"unsortable\">Result</th><th data-align=\"right\" data-sort-type=\"currency\">Prize</th></tr><tr style=\"display:none\"><td></td></tr><tr class=\"table2__row--body\"><td data-nowrap=\"\">2026-06-07</td><td data-align=\"center\" data-nowrap=\"\" data-sort-value=\"1\"><span class=\"placement-box placement-1\"><span class=\"placement-text\">1st</span></span></td><td data-nowrap=\"\" data-sort-value=\"A5\"><span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">D-Tier</span></td><td data-nowrap=\"\" data-sort-value=\"Apex Assembly Cup\"><span class=\"league-icon-small-image\"></span></td><td data-nowrap=\"\" data-sort-value=\"Apex Assembly Cup\"><a href=\"/Apex_Assembly_Cup\" title=\"Openfront/Apex Assembly Cup\">Apex Assembly Cup</a></td><td data-align=\"center\" data-nowrap=\"\"></td><td data-nowrap=\"\">-</td><td data-align=\"right\" data-nowrap=\"\">-</td></tr><tr class=\"table2__row--body table2__row--highlighted\"><td data-nowrap=\"\">2026-03-29</td><td data-align=\"center\" data-nowrap=\"\" data-sort-value=\"1\"><span class=\"placement-box placement-1\"><span class=\"placement-text\">1st</span></span></td><td data-nowrap=\"\" data-sort-value=\"A3\"><span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">B-Tier</span></td><td data-nowrap=\"\" data-sort-value=\"UN Olympics - Trios\"><span class=\"league-icon-small-image\"></span></td><td data-